      "writtenOn": "2023-06-21T18:05:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for your hard work, Shraddha! The code now looks much more clear. I think, we can make it even easier to read and analyze, please see my comment on the `SubmixRoute` class. Other than that, looks good.",
      "revId": "10f4d3c17c9c94d5bd9cb432b642c5c4dfc78793",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9d231bb7_5a7bfb4d",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/include/core-impl/StreamRemoteSubmix.h",
        "patchSetId": 13
      },
      "lineNbr": 58,
      "author": {
        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-21T18:05:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After looking at the code in `DriverRemoteSubmix`, I think we can leverage encapsulation and conceal all the manipulations of the fields of `SubmixRoute`, including lock taking, to class methods. This will make the code of `DriverRemoteSubmix` much easier to analyze. This will also make impossible to take a `DriverRemoteSubmix::mSubmixRoutesLock` while `SubmixRoute::lock` is being held.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 58,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 58,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "10f4d3c17c9c94d5bd9cb432b642c5c4dfc78793",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
