        "id": 1590836
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-26T18:06:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Drivers will share data via this vector. Since multiple drivers have access to same vector added mutex for data protection. Should I modify the approach?",
      "parentUuid": "971f0aa5_6414005c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 119,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 119,
        "endChar": 10
